[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0507","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-2050","title":"GIMP HDR 文件解析堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"GIMP 的 HDR 文件解析功能存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于在将用户数据复制到堆缓冲区前未正确验证数据长度，导致可写入越界数据。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意页面或打开特制的 HDR 文件触发该漏洞，实现以当前进程上下文的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 GIMP 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高，需用户交互配合利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-2050"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:46Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:19:28Z","remediation":"立即将 GIMP 升级至 3.2.4 或更高版本（2026 年 4 月发布，已修复底层 GEGL 库的 HDR 解析漏洞）。RHEL 8 用户安装 gegl >= 0.2.0-40.el8_10（RHSA-2026:38485），RHEL 9 用户安装 gegl04 >= 0.4.62-1.el9_8.1（RHSA-2026:38497）。如无法升级，在文件关联设置中取消 .hdr 文件与 GIMP 的默认关联，并教育用户不要打开来源不明的 HDR 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gegl/-/merge_requests/241","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-282/","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:38485","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:38497","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-2050","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2492593","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-2050.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/2xxx/CVE-2026-2050.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-2050.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_3_CVE-2026-2050.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-2050","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/2xxx/CVE-2026-2050.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-2050.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-2050.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-j4fq-jj5r-8w3h/GHSA-j4fq-jj5r-8w3h.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2026-2050","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-2050.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0459","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-10043","title":"MosaicML Composer 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MosaicML Composer 在解析检查点（checkpoint）文件时存在反序列化不可信数据漏洞（CWE-502）。由于对用户提供的数据缺乏充分验证，攻击者可构造恶意的检查点文件，诱导用户访问恶意页面或打开恶意文件触发反序列化，从而在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 MosaicML Composer 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。用户交互是成功利用该漏洞的必要条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-10043"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:46Z","updated":"2026-06-25T19:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 MosaicML Composer 至包含 PR #3937 修复的版本（≥v0.32.2 或后续发布版），该版本在 `composer/checkpoint/load.py` 中引入 `_RestrictedUnpickler` 白名单机制，仅允许反序列化已知安全类型（datetime.timedelta、numpy.ndarray、torch.Tensor 等），并强制 `_torch_load_with_validation` 使用 `weights_only=True`。如无法立即升级，切勿加载来源不可信的 checkpoint 文件，并在加载任何第三方 checkpoint 前使用 `load_ignore_keys = [\"state/train_metrics/*\", \"state/eval_metrics/*\"]` 跳过可能包含恶意载荷的状态条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mosaicml/composer/commit/6405188805a0054b4551ec49e4919c54c971d0e8","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-384/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/10xxx/CVE-2026-10043.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-10043.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/10xxx/CVE-2026-10043.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-10043.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-10043.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-cv8h-j5cx-fg4f/GHSA-cv8h-j5cx-fg4f.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-10043.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-10043.json","https://github.com/slowslowgogo/SecurityReport/blob/9c2fe25b94c7c3f24908c5b82631ca477488eb4f/output/brief_2026-06-25.html","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-18156.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0459.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0459.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0459.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0327","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49851","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器 parse_link_text CPU耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mistune（Python Markdown 解析器）的 `parse_link_text` 函数在处理大量连续 `[` 字符时存在二次时间复杂度（O(n²)）问题。外层循环每次仅前进 1 个字符，而每次失败调用都会对剩余字符串执行 O(n) 扫描，导致 CPU 资源耗尽。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过提交特制的 Markdown 文本（约 6KB 载荷即可使 CPU 阻塞数秒）触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。建议升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49851","GHSA-qcq2-496w-v96p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T18:17:18Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:36Z","remediation":"升级 Mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`）。如无法立即升级，可在解析用户输入的 Markdown 前，限制输入长度（如 ≤4096 字符）或过滤连续 `[` 字符超过一定数量的输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-qcq2-496w-v96p","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-49851","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2492304","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/6e369fe949505e1dc883cfb94007db49540c4eb2/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/mistune/CVE-2026-49851.yml","https://github.com/open-metadata/OpenMetadata/blob/44fd6c3226025b73c0bba33d0b041db52635de78/ingestion/setup.py","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49851","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49851.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0327.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0327.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0719","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0719.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54639","title":"style-dictionary convertTokenData 原型污染漏洞","description":"Style Dictionary 是一个用于创建跨平台样式的构建系统。其 `convertTokenData()` 工具函数存在原型污染漏洞。攻击者可构造包含 `__proto__` 键的恶意 token 数组，例如 `[{ key: '{__proto__.foo}', value: 'malicious' }]`，当 `convertTokenData()` 处理该数组时，会将恶意键注入 `Object.prototype`，导致全局原型链被篡改。该漏洞影响 Style Dictionary 4.3.0 至 5.4.3 版本，已在 5.4.4 版本中修复。攻击条件为：攻击者需具有对 token 数据的读写权限，且 Style Dictionary 以 `output: 'object'` 模式运行，或通过 Expand API 及 transform 生命周期间接触发。在 NodeJS 服务端应用中使用时影响严重，Web 应用中影响中等。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54639","GHSA-vj5c-m527-mpff"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T01:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-25T20:18:11Z","remediation":"升级到 style-dictionary 5.4.4 或更高版本，修复原型污染漏洞。若无法立即升级，请对 token 数据进行递归校验，过滤所有包含 `__proto__` 的键名；在使用 StyleDictionary 实例时设置 `expand: false` 以阻止第二种攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/style-dictionary/style-dictionary/commit/209085d9782cfc0783c4d983f3f1bb2c515954ec","https://github.com/style-dictionary/style-dictionary/commit/23b5e8dda143441f0d6b8e2b4222e2da98058bc5","https://github.com/style-dictionary/style-dictionary/pull/1702","https://github.com/style-dictionary/style-dictionary/security/advisories/GHSA-vj5c-m527-mpff","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54639.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/npm/style-dictionary/CVE-2026-54639.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/6dd9892dd68397ee98232ad0e1fed55a1599cf70/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54639.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/da2872f085e0dec009c55ece506a2240174e7581/content/posts/cve-2026-54639.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0719.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0708","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54588","title":"Poweradmin Poweradmin OIDC/SAML回调URL主机头注入漏洞","description":"Poweradmin 是一款基于 Web 的 PowerDNS 管理工具。其 OIDC、SAML 及注销认证流程在构建回调 URL 时，直接使用攻击者可控的 HTTP_HOST 请求头作为主机名来源，且未进行任何验证或过滤。攻击者无需认证即可通过伪造 Host 头或利用反向代理配置不当（如 nginx 默认的 proxy_set_header Host $http_host），将 redirect_uri 劫持为攻击者控制的域名，使身份提供商在用户授权后将授权码发送至攻击者服务器，从而实现无需凭证的完整账户接管。该漏洞影响 Poweradmin 4.3.2 及之前版本（4.2.x 系列），同时波及 SAML ACS/SLO URL 和注销重定向构造三个独立代码路径。攻击成功后，攻击者可进一步接管 PowerDNS 管理权限，导致域名劫持、邮件拦截、SSL 证书伪造等严重连锁危害。厂商已在 v4.2.4 和 v4.3.3 版本中修复此问题，建议用户立即升级并配置 interface.base_url 以激活安全分支。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54588","GHSA-3735-5339-xfwx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-23T23:16:49Z","updated":"2026-06-25T20:18:11Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Poweradmin v4.2.4 或 v4.3.3，该版本已修复 HTTP_HOST 头在 OIDC/SAML/登出重定向中的未验证使用问题。若无法立即升级，可在 config/settings.php 中设置 interface.base_url 为可信域名（如 https://admin.example.com），使 SamlConfigurationService 走安全分支代码路径，避免使用 HTTP_HOST 构造回调 URL。临时缓解措施：在反向代理层严格校验 Host 头，拒绝非信任域名的请求，nginx 配置中使用 proxy_set_header Host $server_name 替代 $http_host。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/poweradmin/poweradmin/releases/tag/v4.2.4","https://github.com/poweradmin/poweradmin/releases/tag/v4.3.3","https://github.com/poweradmin/poweradmin/security/advisories/GHSA-3735-5339-xfwx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54588.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-545xx/CVE-2026-54588.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/6dd9892dd68397ee98232ad0e1fed55a1599cf70/reports/2026-06-23/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54588.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/packagist/poweradmin/poweradmin/CVE-2026-54588.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0584","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54651","title":"Python PDF 库 writer 模块线程/文章处理无限循环漏洞","description":"pypdf 是一个纯 Python 编写的开源 PDF 库，其 Writer 组件在处理包含线程/文章（threads/articles）结构的 PDF 文件时存在无限循环漏洞（CWE-835）。攻击者可以构造特制的 PDF 文件，当受害者使用 pypdf 库合并或处理该文件时，程序会陷入无限循环，导致拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 pypdf 6.13.1 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，但需要本地交互（如诱导用户打开恶意 PDF）。CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。官方已在 pypdf 6.13.1 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54651","GHSA-g9xf-7f8q-9mcj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-22T21:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-24T16:41:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 pypdf 到 6.13.1 及以上版本以修复无限循环漏洞。如无法立即升级，可应用来自 PR #3839 的临界修复，该修复限制了文章/线程的嵌套深度以防止无限循环。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/3839","https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.13.1","https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/security/advisories/GHSA-g9xf-7f8q-9mcj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54651.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54651.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/pypdf/CVE-2026-54651.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54651","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54651.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-54651.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54651.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9cd2bb0b0eb73e13c8961a77b5af61d5a521984f/vulns/pypdf/PYSEC-2026-3018.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-g9xf-7f8q-9mcj/GHSA-g9xf-7f8q-9mcj.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54651.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0754","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0754.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50559","title":"Red Hat Quarkus 路径规范化认证授权绕过漏洞","description":"Quarkus 是一款用于构建云原生应用的 Java 框架，其基于路径的 HTTP 授权策略存在路径规范化绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过在请求路径中注入编码分号（%3B）绕过安全层的矩阵参数过滤，从而未经授权访问受保护的 API 端点；同时可利用编码斜杠（%2F）或反斜杠（%5C）绕过静态资源路径策略，访问受保护文件。根本原因在于安全层使用 normalizedPath() 进行部分解码后，pathWithoutMatrixParams() 仅搜索字面分号而无法识别编码后的 %3B，导致策略匹配失效。该漏洞影响 Quarkus 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50559","GHSA-qcxp-gm7m-4j5v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-19T21:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-30T12:18:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Quarkus 至 3.37.0、3.36.3、3.33.2.1/3.33.3、3.27.4.1/3.27.5 或 3.20.6.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx/HAProxy）对请求路径进行完整 URL 解码后校验，拦截包含 `%3B`、`%2F`、`%5C` 的路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/security/advisories/GHSA-qcxp-gm7m-4j5v","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26017","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26018","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26194","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26586","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:34608","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36820","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:48151","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-50559","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2486959","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-50559.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-50559.md","https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/blob/d949daae1659da9b7853d65fdd91f5ed3b6b9a1e/_posts/2026-17-06-CVE-2026-50559.adoc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50559.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50559.json","https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io/blob/6a746d5b8bf10b70a54f4dfdbf8360360d811c2b/l10n/po/ja_JP/_posts/2026-17-06-CVE-2026-50559.adoc.po","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50559.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50559.json","https://github.com/quarkusio/pt.quarkus.io/blob/94559eeac8e2469a77a4f4b8ceb8c6e1b48352e6/l10n/po/pt_BR/_posts/2026-17-06-CVE-2026-50559.adoc.po","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50559.md","https://github.com/quarkusio/cn.quarkus.io/blob/0463c745f96ef7fb4989009e8a0597c4b0ff6838/l10n/po/zh_CN/_posts/2026-17-06-CVE-2026-50559.adoc.po"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0754.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0468","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0468.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12390","title":"AzeoTech DAQFactory 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AzeoTech DAQFactory 21.1 及之前版本中存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞。攻击者通过构造特制的 .ctl 控制文件，诱使目标用户打开该文件后，可触发类型混淆漏洞，导致在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 DAQFactory 全系列旧版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。攻击需要用户交互（打开恶意文件），但无需任何权限，适用于本地攻击场景，可造成机密性、完整性和可用性的完全丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12390"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-18T19:16:22Z","updated":"2026-07-15T15:25:43Z","remediation":"立即将 AzeoTech DAQFactory 升级至 21.1 以上版本（如有新版发布）。如无法升级，采取以下缓解措施：禁止打开来源不明的 .ctl 文件；将 .ctl 文件存放目录权限设置为仅管理员可写入；在加载外部文档时启用安全模式（Safe Mode）；为工程文档设置编辑密码以防止未授权修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-169-02","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12390.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-18/TIER_3_CVE-2026-12390.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12390.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-12390.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-12390.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-m6fh-8jwg-xrjx/GHSA-m6fh-8jwg-xrjx.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/af3ec18db929c83abb4c7eabab93ce71914a58e7/reports/2026/07/intel--1784857057_CVE-2026-12390_CVE-2026-16804_CVE-2026-2.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-12390.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/07/2026-07-24-report.md","https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project/blob/5538b1613093673931222be0ab4f9449da32d3d0/ICS-CERT_ADV/CISA_ICS_ADV_2026_7_23_26.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0468.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0124","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-8461","title":"FFmpeg MagicYUV 解码器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FFmpeg 的 libavcodec 库中 MagicYUV 解码器存在堆越界写入漏洞，当处理特制且含有奇数 slice_height 的 MagicYUV 视频数据时，未正确校验边界导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可构造恶意媒体文件诱导用户解析，触发拒绝服务或在特定条件下实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 FFmpeg 8.1.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8461"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-18T14:17:36Z","updated":"2026-07-15T01:17:04Z","remediation":"升级 FFmpeg 至 8.1.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 libavcodec/magicyuv.c 中 slice_height 校验缺失导致的堆越界写入问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 FFmpeg 处理 MagicYUV 格式视频时，通过输入验证拦截非标准分辨率的畸形文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/23159","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-8461","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2490308","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-8461.json","https://github.com/anyanything/CVE-2026-8461-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-8461.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/b8e3689479dcc208ed0de3d981f1d920da8a901e/security/vex/wix/CVE-2026-8461.vex.json","https://github.com/Xe/site/blob/9c3b5e8e7172270ee14d9e75be6ee2522cf6f373/lume/src/shitposts/no-way-to-prevent-this/memory-safety/CVE-2026-8461.md","https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/blob/8c1f7c825c287551f454fd382f594e7f6d481363/setup/unix-ci.py","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-8461%20PixelSmash/README.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-06/CVE-2026-8461%EF%BC%88PixelSmash%EF%BC%89%20-%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0.md","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-8461/blob/5da81141c1002e92b7f029d3e6d1f0deb8737e20/CVE-2026-8461.py","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-18/TIER_3_CVE-2026-8461.md","https://github.com/murtaza-nasir/speakr/blob/2f7d5871b40d0a3ee79bbe7388f2a44cbbee3803/Dockerfile","https://github.com/Y5neKO/CVE-2026-8461-EXP","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/ray-goldman/ffmpeg-jellyfix","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8461"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0340","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50141","title":"Woodpecker CI gRPC 跨租户代理身份伪造漏洞","description":"Woodpecker CI 的 gRPC 层存在身份验证绕过漏洞（CWE-290），已认证的攻击者可向 gRPC 元数据中注入伪造的 `agent_id` 值，从而模拟同一服务器上的任意其他代理。服务端虽正确验证了 JWT 令牌，但随后丢弃了已验证的代理身份，转而使用客户端提供的值。该漏洞影响 Woodpecker CI 3.0.0 至 3.14.1 版本，攻击者只需低权限即可实施跨租户代理模拟攻击，可能导致高完整性影响。官方已在 3.14.1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50141","GHSA-g7mm-9vx7-jm7h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-18T14:17:29Z","updated":"2026-06-23T15:44:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Woodpecker CI 至 v3.14.1 或更高版本，该版本在 gRPC 层正确验证 agent_id 身份，防止元数据伪造。如无法立即升级，设置环境变量 `WOODPECKER_DISABLE_USER_AGENT_REGISTRATION=true` 禁用组织代理注册，并删除所有现有组织代理，以消除跨租户模拟攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker-security/issues/21","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/issues/6541","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/pull/6567","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/pull/6569","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/security/advisories/GHSA-g7mm-9vx7-jm7h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50141.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-18/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50141.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/go.woodpecker-ci.org/woodpecker/v3/CVE-2026-50141.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5976.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e7c6991b7f94cb67229705ae6024a8abb41a02d5/cve/CVE-2026-50141.html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/69057bcb6031b1cea28108d52631b2209d46077a/data/2026/CVE-2026-50141.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0107","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55200","title":"libssh2 libssh2 越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"libssh2 库的 `ssh2_transport_read()` 函数在解析 SSH 数据包时未对 `packet_length` 字段做上限校验，存在越界写入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向使用 libssh2 的客户端或服务端发送特制 SSH 数据包，通过设置超大的 `packet_length` 值触发堆内存破坏，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 libssh2 1.11.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55200"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-17T20:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-14T22:17:17Z","remediation":"立即升级到 libssh2 1.11.2 或更高版本（commit 7acf3df 已包含修复）；如无法升级，在调用 SSH 库前对远程返回的 packet_length 字段进行上限校验，拒绝超过 35000 字节的数据包。对于嵌入式场景，可通过重新编译禁用非必要的 SSH 通道功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/commit/97acf3dfda80c91c3a8c9f2372546301d4a1a7a8","https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/pull/2052","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libssh2-out-of-bounds-write-via-unchecked-packet-length-in-transport-c","https://web.archive.org/web/20260623211210/https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/tree/main/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-55200.md","https://github.com/termux/termux-packages/blob/1e587c30d93cbd16fdefa1fd0abf94b9523860bd/packages/libssh2/CVE-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-55200.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/17e115a51737bd35c8d1eb16bcf5ee8e18974f8a/security/vex/wix/CVE-2026-55200.vex.json","https://github.com/The-DevOps-Daily/devops-daily/blob/6e2bbc0a90d267ad0a93082d11c5869a0d48f5f1/content/posts/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-client-side-ssh.md","https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/blob/cdcbe772ed7ee2a36f2d84a93018f820a32a4a9f/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-poc/README.md","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/2c93872ee86efd3dd1377af0737fa806f30be90a/libssh2/fix-CVE-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/TableProApp/TablePro/blob/ffa6f0fd6baca3320ed97c15e8f37220c6ee73e6/scripts/patches/libssh2-cve-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/09c646c9a2bdb336ea7fd97db2a7e34458139c15/Formula/lib/libssh2.rb","https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler/blob/bb20f69a630f80667ed34172490720d4eedf7028/.trivyignore","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-55200","https://github.com/xd20111/CVE-2026-55200","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2026-55200","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-55200"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1097","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46873","title":"Oracle VM VirtualBox VMSVGA设备 权限管理不当漏洞","description":"Oracle VM VirtualBox 的 VMSVGA 显示设备组件存在权限管理不当漏洞，受影响的版本为 7.2.8。具有本地高权限且可登录运行 VirtualBox 所在基础设施的攻击者，可利用该漏洞提升权限并完全接管 Oracle VM VirtualBox。由于攻击发生在宿主基础设施层面，成功利用可能导致影响范围蔓延至同一宿主机上的其他产品（范围变更），造成机密性、完整性和可用性的全面丧失。该漏洞攻击路径为本地，利用难度较高，需要攻击者具备高权限登录条件，CVSS 3.1 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高。Oracle 已发布安全公告修复该漏洞，建议受影响用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46873"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-17T10:54:05Z","updated":"2026-06-18T13:51:15Z","remediation":"请立即安装 Oracle VM VirtualBox 7.2.12 或更高版本的安全更新，这是 Oracle 2026 年 7 月关键补丁更新（CPU）中包含的正式补丁，修复了 VMSVGA 设备的漏洞问题。如果无法立即应用补丁，建议通过虚拟化管理器禁用 VMSVGA设备或将显卡类型降级为VMSVGA_1x1为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cspujun2026.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2026/46xxx/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/46xxx/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2026/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-46873.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-06-16/TIER_3_CVE-2026-46873.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-468xx/CVE-2026-46873.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0097","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54821","title":"WordPress Visual Link Preview 插件敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"WordPress Visual Link Preview 插件 2.3.1 及之前版本存在敏感数据泄露漏洞（CWE-201），订阅者级别用户可通过该漏洞访问本应受限的敏感信息。漏洞原理在于插件生成链接预览时未正确校验用户权限，导致低权限用户能够获取其他用户的私有数据。攻击者仅需以订阅者身份登录 WordPress 站点即可触发该漏洞，无需特殊权限。CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高，影响所有启用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54821"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-25T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即更新 Visual Link Preview 插件至 2.4.0 及以上版本。可在 WordPress 后台仪表盘→插件页面找到 Visual Link Preview 并点击更新，或通过 WP-CLI 执行 wp plugin update visual-link-preview 命令更新。如无法立即更新，建议暂时停用该插件并检查网站日志中订阅者账号是否存在异常预览请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/visual-link-preview/vulnerability/wordpress-visual-link-preview-plugin-2-3-1-sensitive-data-exposure-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54821"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0093","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50656","title":"Microsoft Defender 恶意软件防护引擎本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Defender 恶意软件保护引擎存在不当链接解析漏洞（CWE-59），低权限本地用户可通过创建恶意符号链接诱使 Defender 引擎在处理扫描文件时错误地跟随链接，从而以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意文件操作，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需先获得目标系统本地访问权限，利用难度中等。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50656"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-16T19:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-09T00:17:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Defender 防病毒引擎升级至 1.1.26060.3008 及以上版本。该更新通过 KB2267602 自动分发，也可手动运行 `MpCmdRun.exe -SignaturesUpdate` 强制更新。修复后可在注册表 `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Signature Updates\\Engine Version` 确认版本号。无法立即更新的环境下，可限制非管理员用户对 `%ProgramData%\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender` 目录的写权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50656","https://github.com/MSNightmare/RoguePlanet","https://github.com/g0thamRabb1t/CVE-2026-50656-rogueplanet-validation","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-50656.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%20Windows%20Defender%20RoguePlanet%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-50656/CVE-2026-50656.cpp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50656.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-16/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-10.md","https://github.com/intelseclab/poc-archive/blob/04b0792f70b339b8be808d5728723bfcced1e691/docs/pocs/binary/2026-06-26_cve-2026-50656-rogueplanet-checker/raw.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0b24092e13db3e3bff563fa1dc317cd339e26049/cve/CVE-2026-50656.html","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-50656","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-50656"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0527","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24228","title":"NVIDIA NeMo Framework 反序列化漏洞","description":"NVIDIA NeMo Framework for Linux 存在反序列化不可信数据漏洞（CWE-502），本地攻击者通过向受影响系统提交特制的序列化数据触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致远程代码执行、权限提升、数据篡改及信息泄露。该漏洞影响 NVIDIA NeMo Framework 相关版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问条件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。NVIDIA 已发布安全公告，建议用户及时更新至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24228"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-16T17:16:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T13:20:10Z","remediation":"建议立即将 NVIDIA NeMo Framework 升级至 2.7.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复反序列化信任边界校验问题。如无法立即升级，应限制本地用户对 NeMo Framework 服务的访问权限，仅允许受信任用户执行模型加载与推理操作，并启用输入数据校验机制防止恶意序列化数据传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24228","https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5839","https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-24228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24228.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/nvidia-psirt/CVE-2026-24228.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-06-16/TIER_2_CVE-2026-24228.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24228.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-24228.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-24228.md","https://github.com/NVIDIA/product-security/blob/87cba624878101147040549f75f4b9bb6b69df37/2026/5839/5839.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-j4c5-f359-2237/GHSA-j4c5-f359-2237.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-24228.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/25b8b55e890da1c32d6a701c7eede9e2b1b3a876/doc/2026-06/NVIDIA%20NeM